                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.59.0"&gt;3.59.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Improvements and bug fixes for code coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Automatically enable OTel thread context when AAP is enabled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Continuous Profiler] Bug fixes for arm64 unwinding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] Capture fields of non-null nullable structs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FFE] Add flag selection option to the OpenFeature provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Serverless] Add option to strip injected _datadog context from Lambda payloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Keep running shutdown hooks after one throws (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6220289283" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9617" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9617/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9617"&gt;#9617&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Separate trace normalization from stats processing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6314734734" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9669" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9669/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9669"&gt;#9669&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Fix coverage rewriter and counter lifetime defects (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6307073433" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9663" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9663/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9663"&gt;#9663&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Reject incomplete coverage IPC snapshots at the deadline (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6348820723" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9697" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9697/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9697"&gt;#9697&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ASM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AppSec] Report appsec.waf.requests once per request with block_failure and rate_limited (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6349161871" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9699" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9699/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9699"&gt;#9699&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AppSec] Report WAF input truncation as the RFC defines it (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6368527306" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9711" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9711/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9711"&gt;#9711&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Enable OTel thread context by default when AppSec is enabled (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6420894768" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9721" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9721/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9721"&gt;#9721&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] Test the source method of a generic async method called with a reference type (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6442628397" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9730" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9730/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9730"&gt;#9730&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Pin libunwind 2420d068 (v1.8.3-custom-3) and test bad frame pointers (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6352102405" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9704" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9704/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9704"&gt;#9704&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Make MustExportAfterStop independent of collector timing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6352550805" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9705" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9705/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9705"&gt;#9705&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Fix SIGSEGV handler hang on the second NullReferenceException (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6367662955" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9710" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9710/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9710"&gt;#9710&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Debugger&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Clear cached probe data when a probe is removed (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6118469013" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9565" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9565/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9565"&gt;#9565&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Require segment boundaries in line probe exact path match (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6125862873" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9570" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9570/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9570"&gt;#9570&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Fix EverGrowingCollection growth when index is twice the capacity (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6326556185" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9680" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9680/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9680"&gt;#9680&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Publish method metadata entries and probe updates as one reference (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6327601039" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9681" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9681/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9681"&gt;#9681&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Capture fields of non-null nullable structs (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6423796603" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9723" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9723/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9723"&gt;#9723&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Feature Flags and experimentation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FFE] Add a flag selection option to the OpenFeature provider (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6246753379" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9642" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9642/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9642"&gt;#9642&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FFE] Fix holdouts review follow-ups for ExposureHook and deferred exposures (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6248141627" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9644" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9644/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9644"&gt;#9644&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FFE] Send DD-Service on agentless configuration requests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6334094335" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9687" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9687/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9687"&gt;#9687&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Serverless&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Serverless] Add option to strip injected _datadog context from Lambda payloads (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5876535033" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9445" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9445/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9445"&gt;#9445&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
