&lt;li&gt;[AAS] Split the agent keep-alive loop into one method per step (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6120144056" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9568" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9568/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9568"&gt;#9568&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Miscellaneous&lt;/h3&gt;
