&lt;li&gt;Stop using an &lt;code&gt;async void&lt;/code&gt; method in a delegate (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6307519467" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9664" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9664/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9664"&gt;#9664&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
